{"title": "Thailand: School shooting and lightning strike incidents reported", "summary": "A student opened fire at a high school in Thailand's Nonthaburi province on Friday, resulting in multiple casualties. Reports indicate that seven people were killed and 15 were injured in the school shooting. Among the deceased was a teacher, and the injured included students. The student who carried out the shooting also died. Separately, a 24-year-old footballer was killed by a lightning strike during a match in southern Thailand.", "summary_points": ["A student shot and killed seven people, including a teacher, and injured 15 others at a high school in Thailand's Nonthaburi province.", "The student gunman also died following the incident.", "Injured individuals included students.", "In a separate event, a 24-year-old footballer was killed by a lightning strike during a match in southern Thailand."], "title_hi": "थाईलैंड: स्कूल में गोलीबारी और बिजली गिरने की घटनाओं की खबर", "summary_hi": "शुक्रवार को थाईलैंड के नोंगबुरी प्रांत के एक हाई स्कूल में एक छात्र ने गोलीबारी की, जिसमें कई लोग हताहत हुए। रिपोर्टों से पता चलता है कि स्कूल में गोलीबारी की इस घटना में सात लोगों की मौत हुई और 15 घायल हुए। मृतकों में एक शिक्षक भी शामिल था, और घायलों में छात्र भी थे। गोलीबारी करने वाले छात्र की भी मौत हो गई। अलग से, दक्षिणी थाईलैंड में एक मैच के दौरान बिजली गिरने से 24 वर्षीय फुटबॉलर की मौत हो गई।", "summary_points_hi": ["एक छात्र ने थाईलैंड के नोंगबुरी प्रांत के एक हाई स्कूल में सात लोगों, जिनमें एक शिक्षक भी शामिल था, को गोली मारकर मार डाला और 15 अन्य को घायल कर दिया।", "गोलीबारी करने वाले छात्र की भी घटना के बाद मौत हो गई।", "घायलों में छात्र भी शामिल थे।", "एक अलग घटना में, दक्षिणी थाईलैंड में एक मैच के दौरान बिजली गिरने से 24 वर्षीय फुटबॉलर की मौत हो गई।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the school shooting with a higher casualty count (seven killed, 15 wounded)."], "center": ["Reported on the school shooting, noting between two and seven deaths and 15 injuries.", "Mentioned that those injured in the school shooting included students and teachers.", "Also reported on the separate incident of a footballer killed by lightning during a match."], "right": ["Led with the lightning strike killing a footballer during a match, with some outlets also reporting injuries from this event.", "Also covered the school shooting, with some reports stating two deaths and 15 injuries."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["उच्च हताहतों की संख्या (सात की मौत, 15 घायल) के साथ स्कूल गोलीबारी पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["स्कूल में गोलीबारी की सूचना दी, जिसमें दो से सात मौतों और 15 घायलों का उल्लेख किया गया।", "बताया कि स्कूल में गोलीबारी में घायल होने वालों में छात्र और शिक्षक शामिल थे।", "मैच के दौरान बिजली गिरने से मारे गए फुटबॉलर की अलग घटना की भी सूचना दी।"], "right": ["मैच के दौरान एक फुटबॉलर को बिजली गिरने से मारने की घटना को प्रमुखता से दिखाया, कुछ आउटलेट्स ने इस घटना में चोटों की भी सूचना दी।", "स्कूल में गोलीबारी को भी कवर किया, कुछ रिपोर्टों में दो मौतों और 15 घायलों का उल्लेख किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/08/07/1600x900/THAILAND-SHOOTING--9_1786075499953_1786075525164_e3a8daa6-754e-42ae-8a58-5aad4ef1d806.JPG", "sources": [{"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/8/6/lightning-strike-kills-thai-footballer-during-match?traffic_source=rss", "headline": "Lightning strike kills Thai footballer during match"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Football player fatally struck by lightning during Thailand match as several others injured"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/thailand-school-shooting-several-feared-dead-after-student-opens-fire-investigation-underway-11786074750590.html",